      "customData": {
        "kind": "canvas",
        "title": "Respond to the actual limiting control",
        "description": "An alert or block starts an operating cycle: identify the actual limiting control, let an owner choose an approved action, have an administrator apply and confirm it, then review outcomes and improve the response playbook. Human approval is not automatic purchase permission."
